I arrive at our meeting place, but it feels different. Emptier. Colder.
\doctor: L3XA? Are you there?
\doctor: L3XA, please! tell me that you’re still here.
join alien (sonho/feliz e olho aberto) center
alien: Doctor…
alien: You’re here again…
alien: You won’t stop coming after me.
\doctor: You almost died today!
\doctor: Your vitals were on the ground!
\doctor: You- [pause]you crashed the lab!
alien (sonho/triste e boca fecada): I really don’t want to talk about that…
alien (sonho/feliz e olho fechado): You were very good there,saving my life.
alien: I guess I need to thank you.
\doctor: L3XA, I need you to talk to me.
\doctor: Tell me what happened to you.
\doctor: Why did they take you out of the tank last night?
\doctor: Where did they take you?!
\doctor: I don’t understand what’s going on!
alien (sonho/triste e boca fecada): ...
alien: Every night..
alien: They take me out of the tank to get me to a different area of the ship.
alien: They take me to Flagg.
\doctor: To Flagg?!
