alien: ...
alien (sonho/triste e boca aberta): I have been tortured and experimented on, even before I came here.
alien: They opened my body before they even asked my name.
alien: I could’t astroproject yet, so each day was worse than the next.
alien: Then it happened.
alien: The explosion that destroyed that lab, also sent my mind to the astral plane. Here.
alien: When I awoke, I was in this tank. Dr Pulaski was supervising my treatment.
alien: She told me again and again that she was doing what was good for me…
alien: I told her about the telepathy…
alien: But they all only wanted was to test my powers.
alien: So the experiments started…
